OL,3,CMarwell following 'very promising
OL,4,Clead' in search for Samba the missing
OL,5,Ccapybara
OL,7,FSearch teams looking the missing
OL,8,Fcapybara say they are following up 'a
OL,9,Fvery promising lead'.
OL,11,FSamba, a nine-month-old capybara,
OL,12,Fescaped from her enclosure, after she
OL,13,Farrived from Jimmy's Farm and Wildlife
OL,14,FPark in Suffolk with her sister,
OL,15,FTango, on Tuesday 17 March.
OL,17,FTango was quickly put back into her
OL,18,Fenclosure, but Samba managed to evade
OL,19,Fcapture.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
