OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786537135
OL,3,CMarwell following 'very promising
OL,4,Clead' in search for Samba the missing
OL,5,Ccapybara
OL,7,FThe zoo said it was "delighted" to
OL,8,Fbegin caring for the animal, a male
OL,9,Fnamed Ripple, after his transfer from
OL,10,FBlackpool Zoo.
OL,12,FAt the time a park spokesperson
OL,13,Freassured residents that the search
OL,14,Ffor Samba remains a priority.
OL,16,FThey said: "We know many people will
OL,17,Fbe wondering about Samba.
OL,19,F"Welcoming Ripple does not mean we
OL,20,Fhave stopped searching for her.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
